<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
  ATLAS.ti-SHAPED FIXTURE — structure only, no third-party content.

  Reproduces the structural characteristics of an ATLAS.ti 8.4.0 (macOS)
  REFI-QDA export as published in the REFI vendor test set:

    - no inline <PlainTextContent>; every TextSource points at a separate
      archive entry via plainTextPath="internal://<guid>.txt"
    - <Codes> wrapper, flat codebook, Description children on some codes
    - one PlainTextSelection carrying MULTIPLE <Coding> children (codes
      sharing a quotation)
    - one PlainTextSelection with a Description and NO Coding (an uncoded
      quotation, which QualCanvas cannot represent and must report)
    - non-text sources and project-level constructs QualCanvas drops:
      PictureSource, PDFSource, AudioSource, VideoSource, Notes, Links, Sets,
      Graphs
    - a code name containing an XML-escaped quote

  Code names, source names and note text are neutral placeholders. The real
  vendor file is NOT vendored: see docs/qdpx-interoperability-validation.md for
  its provenance, SHA-256 and the command to re-validate against it.
-->
